        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Upgrades:</strong> 1</p><hr /><p>This adamantine knife has a sheet of combustible material folded into its base that can be detonated remotely using a remote in its sheath. When you successfully Strike a creature with a <em>blast knife</em>, you can spend your reaction to release the knife and embed it into your target. A creature must spend an Interact action to remove an embedded <em>blast knife</em>.</p>\n<p><strong>Activate—Remote Detonation</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> (fire, manipulate)</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per 10 minutes</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> Your blast knife explodes, dealing @Damage[1d6[fire]|options:area-damage] damage to all creatures in a @Template[type:emanation|distance:10] or @Damage[2d6[fire]|options:area-damage] damage per weapon damage die if the knife was embedded in a target, with a basic Reflex save equal to your class DC. The knife maneuvers back into its sheath, safely avoiding creatures and obstacles to reach its destination.</p>"
